          },
          "description": "Get ready for a fun, animal-themed Bingo game the whole family can enjoy! With 10 different rounds and 8 printable boards, up to 8 players can join in or a kid can play alone! Listen as animals are called out, mark them on your board, and try to get five in a row to win! This interactive game builds listening skills, focus, and matching abilities while keeping kids entertained. Perfect for ages 4-10, it’s a great way to enjoy screen-free fun at home or on the go!",
